This is one of my favorite songs, originally written by the Sherman Brothers for Walt
Disney's Carousel of Progress for the 1964 New York World Fair and re-done by They Might
Be Giants for Meet the Robinsons. Meet the Robinsons is one of my favorite movies
because, like the Carousel of Progress, it presents Walt's love for technology and making the
future brighter.

